    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet. i keep walking into the kitchen expecting to see him there, but it's just... nothing. it feels like i've been left in a world that doesn't even exist anymore. i don't know how i'm supposed to keep doing this every single day when the only person who made it make sense is gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
