      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are going through an incredibly painful period of grief right now. Please know that what you are feeling—this profound emptiness and disorientation—is a completely natural response to losing someone so central to your life. Be gentle with yourself during this time; there is no timeline for healing, and it's okay to feel utterly lost. If you can, consider reaching out to a friend, family member, or a grief counselor for support right now.",
      "source": "target",
